# Desktop + XP-theming packages, Debian 12 (bookworm).
# Installed by the FULL provision (and the ISO build), but SKIPPED in headless
# mode (BLISS_HEADLESS=1) so the Docker toolkit image and CI smoke test stay
# lean. One package per line; '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.

xfce4
xfce4-goodies
xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin
lightdm
firefox-esr
fonts-liberation
papirus-icon-theme
gtk2-engines-murrine
arc-theme
